    <visualElement><elementName>Text</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Description</string><string>P02 Branch-target adder (carry look-ahead) - Digital task
8-bit version from two 4-bit carry look-ahead blocks (generate/propagate logic, C1..C4 equations). No ripple chain inside a block.
Allowed parts: And, Or, Not, NAnd, NOr, XOr, XNOr + wiring parts
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="100" y="40"/></visualElement>
